    "about": {
      "description": "jupyter-ai-pi-lite runs the pi coding agent (https://pi.dev) in the\nbrowser, as an in-browser persona of Jupyter AI for JupyterLab, Notebook 7\nand JupyterLite. Pi reads and writes the files of JupyterLab; in\nJupyterLite, it runs shell commands in the in-browser cockle shell.\n\n- jupyter-ai-pi-lite: pi as a persona in the chats\n- jupyter-ai-pi-lite-terminal: pi as the `pi` command in the JupyterLite\n  terminal, with the interactive interface of pi itself",
